      "settings": {
        "title": "The DV History",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/DV_History.png",
        "text": "<p>DV Group began in 1957, when three brothers — Dahyabhai, Vithaldas and Ranchhoddas Patel — set up a spice trading desk in Madhupura, Ahmedabad's legendary spice market. Their rule was simple: pure goods, honest weight, no exceptions. That rule travelled through six decades of kirana counters, weddings and festival kitchens, building a network of over 5,000 trade customers across Gujarat and beyond.</p><p>The next generation carried it further — into tea blending, sourcing leaves from Upper Assam's estates and 13,000+ gardens, launching DV Gold and DV Silver across Gujarat's towns. Today, the same family opens its warehouse doors directly to you. The packs are new. The purity isn't.</p>",
        "cta_text": "Know more",
        "cta_link": "",
        "gap": 28,
        "padding-block-start": 48,
        "padding-block-end": 48
